<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Hasil Ekspor</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6; margin: 1in; }
  h1 { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 12pt; }
  h2 { font-size: 15pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 16pt; margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  h3 { font-size: 13pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  p { margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  ul, ol { margin-left: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; }
  li { margin-bottom: 3pt; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 10pt 0; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 5pt 8pt; text-align: left; font-size: 11pt; }
  th { background-color: #e8e8e8; font-weight: bold; }
</style>
</head><body><h1>LEMBAR KERJA PESERTA DIDIK (LKPD)</h1><h2>HEADER LKPD</h2><table style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Judul LKPD</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Introducing Yourself and Others</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Mata Pelajaran</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Bahasa Inggris</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kelas/Semester</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>X / Ganjil (Semester 1)</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Fase</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Fase E-F</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Nama Siswa</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>No. Absen</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Tanggal</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>________________________</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2>KOMPETENSI &amp; TUJUAN PEMBELAJARAN</h2><h3>Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</h3><p>Peserta didik mampu menyusun teks interaksi transaksional lisan dan tulis pendek dan sederhana yang melibatkan tindakan memberi dan meminta informasi terkait perkenalan diri dan orang lain, dengan memperhatikan fungsi sosial, struktur teks, dan unsur kebahasaan yang benar sesuai konteks.</p><h3>Tujuan Pembelajaran (TP) — Format ABCD</h3><table style="min-width: 100px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>A</strong> (Audience)</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>B</strong> (Behavior)</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>C</strong> (Condition)</p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>D</strong> (Degree)</p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Peserta didik</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>mampu menggunakan ungkapan perkenalan diri dan orang lain dengan tepat</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>setelah mengamati contoh dialog dan berlatih secara mandiri serta berpasangan</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>dengan struktur kalimat yang benar dan percaya diri saat presentasi</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Peserta didik</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>mampu menulis teks perkenalan diri sederhana</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>berdasarkan panduan dan contoh yang diberikan</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>minimal 100 kata dengan tata bahasa yang tepat</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Peserta didik</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>mampu melakukan percakapan perkenalan</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>secara berpasangan di depan kelas</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>dengan intonasi, pelafalan, dan bahasa tubuh yang baik</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2>PETUNJUK PENGERJAAN</h2><ol><li><p>Bacalah contoh dialog yang disediakan dengan saksama.</p></li><li><p>Amati ungkapan-ungkapan perkenalan yang digunakan dalam dialog.</p></li><li><p>Kerjakan tugas secara individu terlebih dahulu.</p></li><li><p>Diskusikan dan praktikkan bersama teman sebangku.</p></li><li><p>Waktu pengerjaan: <strong>60 menit</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Aturan kerja:</p><ul><li><p>Dilarang menggunakan ponsel selama pengerjaan (kecuali untuk kamus digital).</p></li><li><p>Tulis jawaban langsung pada lembar kerja ini.</p></li><li><p>Bertanyalah kepada guru jika ada kesulitan.</p></li></ul></li></ol><hr><h2>RINGKASAN MATERI / DASAR TEORI</h2><h3>Ungkapan Perkenalan (Introduction Expressions)</h3><p><strong>A. Introducing Yourself (Memperkenalkan Diri)</strong></p><table style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Formal</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Informal</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Allow me to introduce myself.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Hi, I'm...</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Let me introduce myself.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Hello, my name is...</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>I would like to introduce myself.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Hey, I'm...</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>B. Introducing Others (Memperkenalkan Orang Lain)</strong></p><table style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Formal</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Informal</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>I would like to introduce you to...</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>This is my friend...</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Allow me to introduce Mr./Mrs....</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Meet my classmate...</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Please meet...</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>This is...</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>C. Responses (Tanggapan)</strong></p><table style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Formal</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Informal</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Pleased to meet you.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Nice to meet you.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>How do you do?</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Glad to meet you.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>It's a pleasure to meet you.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Good to meet you.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Subject Pronouns &amp; To Be</h3><table style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Subject Pronoun</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>To Be (Present)</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Contoh</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>I</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>am</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>I am a student.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>You</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>are</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>You are in class X.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>He/She/It</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>is</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>She is my friend.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>We</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>are</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>We are classmates.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>They</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>are</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>They are teachers.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Simple Present Tense dalam Perkenalan</h3><table style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Fungsi</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Rumus</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Contoh</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Menyatakan fakta</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>S + V1 (+s/es)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>I live in Muara Uya.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Menyatakan kebiasaan</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>S + V1 (+s/es)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>She studies at SMKN 2 Muara Uya.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Menggunakan to be</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>S + to be + adjective/noun</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>He is friendly.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2>ALAT DAN BAHAN</h2><table style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>No</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Alat/Bahan</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Keterangan</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>1</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>LKPD ini</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Digunakan untuk menulis jawaban</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>2</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Pulpen/pensil</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Untuk menulis</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>3</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Kamus (cetak/digital)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Untuk mencari kosakata baru</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>4</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Ponsel (opsional)</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Hanya untuk kamus digital</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2>KEGIATAN PEMBELAJARAN</h2><h3>Kegiatan 1: Mengamati / Eksplorasi (10 menit)</h3><p><strong>Bacalah contoh dialog berikut dengan saksama!</strong></p><hr><p><strong>Dialog 1: Perkenalan Diri di Kelas Baru</strong></p><p><strong>Teacher:</strong> Good morning, class! Today we have a new student. Please welcome her.</p><p><strong>Rina:</strong> (smiling) Good morning, everyone. Let me introduce myself. My name is Rina Amelia. I am from Tanjung. I live at Jl. Bangkar, near the school. I am 15 years old. My hobby is reading novels. I hope we can be good friends. Thank you.</p><p><strong>Students:</strong> (applauding) Welcome, Rina!</p><p><strong>Dialog 2: Perkenalan Teman</strong></p><p><strong>Budi:</strong> Hi, Dina! I'd like to introduce you to my friend.</p><p><strong>Dina:</strong> Sure, Budi.</p><p><strong>Budi:</strong> This is Andi. He is from Muara Uya. He is in class X-A.</p><p><strong>Andi:</strong> Hello, Dina. Nice to meet you.</p><p><strong>Dina:</strong> Nice to meet you too, Andi. Are you new here?</p><p><strong>Andi:</strong> Yes, I am. This is my first day.</p><p><strong>Dina:</strong> Welcome to our school!</p><hr><p><strong>Pertanyaan Pengamatan:</strong></p><ol><li><p>Ungkapan apa yang digunakan Rina untuk memperkenalkan diri? Tuliskan 2 ungkapan!</p><hr></li><li><p>Ungkapan apa yang digunakan Budi untuk memperkenalkan Andi?</p><hr></li><li><p>Bagaimana tanggapan Dina saat diperkenalkan dengan Andi?</p><hr></li></ol><hr><h3>Kegiatan 2: Mengumpulkan Informasi (25 menit)</h3><p><strong>Jawablah 5 pertanyaan berikut berdasarkan dialog di atas!</strong></p><ol><li><p>Siapa nama siswa baru yang diperkenalkan di Dialog 1? Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p></li><li><p>Di mana Rina tinggal? Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p></li><li><p>Apa hobi Rina? Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p></li><li><p>Di kelas berapa Andi berada? Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p></li><li><p>Bagaimana perasaan Andi tentang hari pertamanya di sekolah? (berdasarkan dialog) Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p></li></ol><hr><p><strong>Buatlah teks perkenalan diri (100-150 kata) dalam bahasa Inggris!</strong></p><p>Gunakan format berikut sebagai panduan:</p><ul><li><p>Nama lengkap</p></li><li><p>Tempat/tanggal lahir</p></li><li><p>Alamat</p></li><li><p>Hobi</p></li><li><p>Cita-cita</p></li><li><p>Alasan memilih SMKN 2 Muara Uya</p></li><li><p>Harapan di sekolah baru</p></li></ul><p><strong>Tulis jawabanmu di bawah ini!</strong></p><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><h3>Kegiatan 3: Mengolah &amp; Menganalisis (15 menit)</h3><p><strong>Kerjakan tugas berikut secara berpasangan!</strong></p><p><strong>Tugas 1: Analisis Struktur Kalimat</strong></p><p>Perhatikan kalimat-kalimat dari dialog. Identifikasi <strong>subject pronoun</strong> dan <strong>to be</strong> yang digunakan!</p><table style="min-width: 75px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kalimat</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p><strong>Subject Pronoun</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p><strong>To Be</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>My name is Rina Amelia.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>My name</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>is</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>I am from Tanjung.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>I</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>am</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>He is from Muara Uya.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>He</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>is</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>They are in class X-A.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>They</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>are</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Sekarang, buatlah <strong>3 kalimat baru</strong> menggunakan subject pronoun dan to be yang berbeda!</p><ol><li><p></p></li></ol><hr><ul><li><p></p></li></ul><hr><ul><li><p></p></li></ul><hr><hr><p><strong>Tugas 2: Ubah Kalimat ke Simple Present Tense</strong></p><p>Ubah kalimat berikut ke dalam Simple Present Tense yang benar!</p><table style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kalimat Asal</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kalimat Baru (Simple Present)</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Rina (read) novels every day.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Rina reads novels every day.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Andi (live) in Muara Uya.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>They (study) at SMKN 2.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>________________________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>She (have) a hobby.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>________________________________</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h3>Kegiatan 4: Menyimpulkan (10 menit)</h3><p><strong>Berdasarkan pembelajaran hari ini, tuliskan kesimpulanmu!</strong></p><ol><li><p>Sebutkan <strong>3 ungkapan perkenalan diri</strong> yang kamu pelajari hari ini!</p><hr><hr><hr></li><li><p>Jelaskan perbedaan penggunaan <strong>I am</strong>, <strong>You are</strong>, <strong>He/She/It is</strong>!</p><hr><hr><hr></li><li><p>Apa fungsi <strong>Simple Present Tense</strong> dalam perkenalan? Berikan 1 contoh!</p><hr><hr></li></ol><hr><h2>PERTANYAAN / TUGAS (Individu)</h2><h3>Soal 1: Isian Singkat (10 poin)</h3><p>Lengkapi kalimat berikut dengan <strong>to be</strong> yang tepat (am/is/are)!</p><p>a. I __________ a student of SMKN 2 Muara Uya.</p><p>b. She __________ my best friend.</p><p>c. They __________ in the same class.</p><p>d. We __________ happy to meet you.</p><p>e. He __________ from Tanjung.</p><h3>Soal 2: Uraian (20 poin)</h3><p>Terjemahkan kalimat berikut ke dalam Bahasa Inggris!</p><p>a. Saya tinggal di Muara Uya. Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p><p>b. Hobi saya adalah bermain sepak bola. Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p><p>c. Dia (perempuan) adalah teman sekelas saya. Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p><p>d. Kami senang bertemu denganmu. Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p><p>e. Mereka adalah guru-guru di sekolah ini. Jawab: ____________________________________________________________</p><h3>Soal 3: Menyusun Dialog (30 poin)</h3><p>Susunlah dialog perkenalan singkat antara <strong>2 orang</strong> (A dan B) yang mencakup:</p><ul><li><p>Salam pembuka</p></li><li><p>Perkenalan diri (nama, asal, kelas)</p></li><li><p>Pertanyaan tentang hobi</p></li><li><p>Tanggapan</p></li><li><p>Salam penutup</p></li></ul><p>Tulis dialogmu di bawah ini!</p><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><h3>Soal 4: Analisis Kesalahan (20 poin)</h3><p>Perbaiki kesalahan pada kalimat-kalimat berikut!</p><table style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kalimat Salah</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Perbaikan</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>She are a new student.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>______________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>I is from Muara Uya.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>______________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>They is my classmates.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>______________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>He am very friendly.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>______________________</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>We is in class X-A.</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>______________________</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Soal 5: Kreatif — Poster Perkenalan (20 poin)</h3><p>Buatlah <strong>poster perkenalan diri sederhana</strong> dalam bahasa Inggris di area berikut! Sertakan:</p><ul><li><p>Nama</p></li><li><p>Usia</p></li><li><p>Asal</p></li><li><p>Hobi</p></li><li><p>Cita-cita</p></li><li><p>1 fakta unik tentang dirimu</p></li></ul><p><strong>Area Poster:</strong></p><pre><code>+------------------------------------------+
|                                          |
|                                          |
|                                          |
|                                          |
|                                          |
|                                          |
|                                          |
+------------------------------------------+
</code></pre><hr><h2>KESIMPULAN &amp; REFLEKSI</h2><h3>Kesimpulan Siswa</h3><p>Tuliskan <strong>3 hal penting</strong> yang kamu pelajari hari ini!</p><ol><li><p></p></li></ol><hr><ul><li><p></p></li></ul><hr><ul><li><p></p></li></ul><hr><h3>Refleksi Diri</h3><p>Jawablah pertanyaan berikut dengan jujur!</p><ol><li><p><strong>Apa bagian paling mudah</strong> dari pembelajaran hari ini? Mengapa?</p><hr><hr></li><li><p><strong>Apa bagian paling sulit</strong> dari pembelajaran hari ini? Apa yang akan kamu lakukan untuk mengatasinya?</p><hr><hr></li><li><p><strong>Bagaimana perasaanmu</strong> setelah praktik percakapan perkenalan di depan kelas? Apakah kamu merasa percaya diri?</p><hr><hr></li></ol><hr><h2>RUBRIK PENILAIAN</h2><h3>A. Penilaian Teks Perkenalan Diri (Tulisan)</h3><table style="min-width: 125px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Aspek</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Sangat Baik (4)</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Baik (3)</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Cukup (2)</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kurang (1)</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kesesuaian Isi</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Isi lengkap, sesuai topik, dan terstruktur dengan baik</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Isi lengkap dan sesuai topik</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Isi kurang lengkap atau kurang sesuai</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Isi tidak sesuai topik</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Tata Bahasa (Grammar)</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Tidak ada kesalahan tata bahasa</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>1-2 kesalahan tata bahasa</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>3-4 kesalahan tata bahasa</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Lebih dari 4 kesalahan</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kosakata (Vocabulary)</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Menggunakan variasi kosakata yang tepat</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Menggunakan kosakata yang tepat</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Kosakata terbatas</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Kosakata sangat terbatas</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Panjang Teks</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>130-150 kata</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>100-129 kata</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>70-99 kata</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Kurang dari 70 kata</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>B. Penilaian Praktik Percakapan (Presentasi)</h3><table style="min-width: 125px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Aspek</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Sangat Baik (4)</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Baik (3)</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Cukup (2)</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kurang (1)</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Pelafalan (Pronunciation)</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Sangat jelas dan mudah dipahami</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Jelas dan dapat dipahami</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Kurang jelas, beberapa kata sulit dipahami</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Tidak jelas, sulit dipahami</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Intonasi &amp; Ekspresi</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Intonasi natural, ekspresi sesuai</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Intonasi cukup natural</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Intonasi datar, ekspresi kurang</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Tidak ada intonasi dan ekspresi</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kepercayaan Diri</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Sangat percaya diri, kontak mata baik</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Percaya diri, ada kontak mata</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Kurang percaya diri</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Tidak percaya diri, membaca terus</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kerjasama (berpasangan)</strong></p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Responsif dan saling mendukung</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Cukup responsif</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Kurang responsif</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Tidak ada kerjasama</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>C. Penilaian Jawaban Soal</h3><table style="min-width: 50px;"><colgroup><col style="min-width: 25px;"><col style="min-width: 25px;"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p><strong>Skor per Soal</strong></p></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p><strong>Kriteria</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>4</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Jawaban benar, lengkap, dan tepat</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>3</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Jawaban benar tetapi kurang lengkap</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>2</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Jawaban kurang tepat</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: center;"><p>1</p></td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" style="text-align: left;"><p>Jawaban salah atau tidak dijawab</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Nilai Akhir</h3><p>$$Nilai = \frac{Total\ Skor\ yang\ Diperoleh}{Total\ Skor\ Maksimal} \times 100$$</p><hr><p><strong>Selamat Mengerjakan!"Practice makes perfect — keep introducing yourself with confidence!"</strong></p></body></html>